==== camelCase, snake_case and UPPERCASE words
fooBar baz_qux HTTPServer x
----
eeeeeeegegegegegege

==== punctuation, hyphens between letters, numbers
a.b->c(d) foo-bar a-1 123 0x1f #ff00aa #A
----
eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeegegegegegegegege

==== e doesn't stop on empty lines, ge does
a

b


c
----
eeeegegegege

==== counts
one two three four
----
3e2ge

==== ge with nothing before it goes to the start of the line
  a b
----
llgege

==== ge with a count runs into the start of the buffer
[{A
----
2e2ge

==== de at the end of the buffer deletes the last character
a b
----
eede

==== dge onto an empty line covers its line break
a

b
----
jdge

==== dge on the first empty line joins it
a!

a
----
dedge

==== E and gE
a.b->c(d) foo-bar
  x
----
EEEgEgEgE

==== dgE at the start of the buffer deletes the first character
aA
----
dgE

==== d2gE running into the start of the buffer
aaa
----
ld2gE

==== dgE onto an empty line covers its line break
aA

 a
----
EEgEdgE

==== dE from an empty line covers its line break
a

b
c
----
jdE

==== E at the end of the buffer stays put
a b
----
EEE

==== dE at the end of the buffer deletes the character under the cursor
a b
----
EEdE

==== gE with nothing before it goes to the start of the line
  a b
----
llgEgE

==== gE with a count stops at the first WORD if it runs out
  a b
----
llll2gE

